<div style="text-align:center;margin:0 0 8px 0;padding:4px 8px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:5px;"><strong style="font-size:11px;color:var(--blue);">📊 文具店季度銷售數據（參考圖表）</strong><svg height="91" viewbox="0 0 540 175" width="280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><pattern height="6" id="m-hatchA" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="6"><rect fill="#3B82F6" height="6" width="6"></rect><line stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" x1="0" x2="6" y1="0" y2="6"></line></pattern><pattern height="6" id="m-hatchB" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="6"><rect fill="#F97316" height="6" width="6"></rect><line stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1" x1="6" x2="0" y1="0" y2="6"></line></pattern><pattern height="6" id="m-hatchC" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="6"><rect fill="#1D4ED8" height="6" width="6"></rect><line stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5" x1="0" x2="6" y1="0" y2="6"></line></pattern><pattern height="6" id="m-hatchD" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="6"><rect fill="#EA580C" height="6" width="6"></rect><line stroke="#FED7AA" stroke-width="1" x1="6" x2="0" y1="0" y2="6"></line></pattern></defs><line stroke="#333" stroke-width="1" x1="50" x2="50" y1="20" y2="128"></line><line stroke="#333" stroke-width="1" x1="50" x2="530" y1="128" y2="128"></line><text fill="#666" font-size="8" text-anchor="end" x="42" y="132">0</text><text fill="#666" font-size="8" text-anchor="end" x="42" y="84">100</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="50" x2="530" y1="84" y2="84"></line><text fill="#666" font-size="8" text-anchor="end" x="42" y="40">200</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="50" x2="530" y1="40" y2="40"></line><rect fill="url(#m-hatchA)" height="44" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="68" y="84"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchB)" height="32" stroke="#C2410C" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="84" y="96"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchC)" height="56" stroke="#1E40AF" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="100" y="72"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchD)" height="38" stroke="#9A3412" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="116" y="90"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="8" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="109" y="138">一月</text><rect fill="url(#m-hatchA)" height="52" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="168" y="76"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchB)" height="38" stroke="#C2410C" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="184" y="90"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchC)" height="64" stroke="#1E40AF" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="200" y="64"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchD)" height="44" stroke="#9A3412" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="216" y="84"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="8" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="209" y="138">二月</text><rect fill="url(#m-hatchA)" height="64" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="268" y="64"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchB)" height="52" stroke="#C2410C" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="284" y="76"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchC)" height="72" stroke="#1E40AF" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="300" y="56"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchD)" height="56" stroke="#9A3412" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="316" y="72"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="8" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="309" y="138">三月</text><rect fill="url(#m-hatchA)" height="56" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="368" y="72"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchB)" height="46" stroke="#C2410C" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="384" y="82"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchC)" height="68" stroke="#1E40AF" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="400" y="60"></rect><rect fill="url(#m-hatchD)" height="52" stroke="#9A3412" stroke-width="0.5" width="14" x="416" y="76"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="8" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="409" y="138">四月</text><rect fill="url(#m-hatchA)" height="7" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="0.3" width="10" x="110" y="153"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="7" x="123" y="160">A店筆記本</text><rect fill="url(#m-hatchB)" height="7" stroke="#C2410C" stroke-width="0.3" width="10" x="180" y="153"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="7" x="193" y="160">A店文件夾</text><rect fill="url(#m-hatchC)" height="7" stroke="#1E40AF" stroke-width="0.3" width="10" x="250" y="153"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="7" x="263" y="160">B店筆記本</text><rect fill="url(#m-hatchD)" height="7" stroke="#9A3412" stroke-width="0.3" width="10" x="320" y="153"></rect><text fill="#333" font-size="7" x="333" y="160">B店文件夾</text></svg><div style="font-size:8px;color:var(--gray);">▲ 請參考以上圖表作答。完整版見第2頁。</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：數據比較與分析<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>從複合棒形圖中做數據比較的四種基本問題：</strong><br/>
      ❶ <strong>求差</strong>：兩條棒的高度差 = 數值相減（「多幾多」「少幾多」「相差」）<br/>
      ❷ <strong>求和</strong>：多條棒合計 = 各數值相加（「共」「合共」「總共」）<br/>
      ❸ <strong>求倍數</strong>：一條棒是另一條的幾倍 = 較大值 ÷ 較小值<br/>
      ❹ <strong>比較趨勢</strong>：同一顏色棒在四個月份的走勢 → 上升／下降／先升後降
    </div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">❶</div><div class="t">求差</div><div class="d">大的減小的<br/>「相差」「多幾多」</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">❷</div><div class="t">求和</div><div class="d">全部加起來<br/>「合共」「總共」</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">❸</div><div class="t">求倍數</div><div class="d">大的 ÷ 小的<br/>「是…的幾倍」</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">❹</div><div class="t">看趨勢</div><div class="d">同一組別<br/>逐月變化方向</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例3：根據複合棒形圖，哪一個月份「A店筆記本」銷量最高？該月A店筆記本銷量是B店文件夾銷量的多少倍？（取至整數）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例4：根據複合棒形圖，描述「B店筆記本」由一月至四月的銷量變化趨勢。</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>根據複合棒形圖：三月份，A店筆記本比A店文件夾多賣多少件？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>根據複合棒形圖：一月份，B店兩類商品合共賣了多少件？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>根據複合棒形圖：四月份，B店筆記本銷量是A店文件夾銷量的多少倍？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>根據複合棒形圖：哪一間店舖（A店或B店）在一至四月的「筆記本」總銷量較高？高出多少件？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：製作複合棒形圖<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>從數據表繪製複合棒形圖的步驟：</strong><br/>
      ❶ <strong>定縱軸刻度</strong>：找出數據中最大值，確定每格代表多少（通常取 2、5、10、20、25、50、100）<br/>
      ❷ <strong>畫坐標軸</strong>：橫軸寫分類名稱（如月份），縱軸標刻度數字和單位<br/>
      ❸ <strong>畫棒</strong>：每組內依序畫出不同花紋的棒（圖例順序）；棒的高度 = 數據值 ÷ 每格代表值 × 格高<br/>
      ❹ <strong>加圖例</strong>：在圖表旁邊或下方標示每種花紋代表甚麼<br/>
      ❺ <strong>寫標題</strong>：圖表上方寫清楚標題
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例5：下表是兩班同學課外活動人數。如要用複合棒形圖表示，縱軸每一格代表5人合適嗎？為甚麼？<br/><table class="dt"><tr><th></th><th>足球</th><th>籃球</th><th>游泳</th><th>跑步</th></tr><tr><td>5A班</td><td>12</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>5B班</td><td>10</td><td>14</td><td>9</td><td>11</td></tr></table></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例6：根據上表數據，計算 5A班 和 5B班 各活動總人數，並判斷哪個活動最受歡迎。</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 製作陷阱：縱軸格值選太大 → 棒太矮難分辨；選太小 → 棒超出圖表範圍！</div>
<div class="mn">📐 刻度口訣：「睇最大值，除格數，取整數（2/5/10倍），一格一格畫清楚」</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點三 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>下表為兩店四個月銷售總額。若縱軸每格代表 100 元，畫出最高值需多少格？<br/><table class="dt"><tr><th>月份</th><th>一月</th><th>二月</th><th>三月</th><th>四月</th></tr><tr><td>A店總額($)</td><td>300</td><td>450</td><td>520</td><td>380</td></tr><tr><td>B店總額($)</td><td>280</td><td>500</td><td>480</td><td>420</td></tr></table></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>承上題數據表：如果要繪製複合棒形圖，每格代表 50 元，B店三月銷量的棒應畫多少格？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>下表是兩組學生的測驗分數（滿分100）。如果縱軸由 60 分開始而不是由 0 開始，會有甚麼問題？<br/><table class="dt"><tr><th></th><th>中文</th><th>英文</th><th>數學</th></tr><tr><td>甲組平均</td><td>72</td><td>68</td><td>75</td></tr><tr><td>乙組平均</td><td>80</td><td>75</td><td>85</td></tr></table></td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>根據複合棒形圖中的數據，自行繪製一個簡單的數據表，記錄 A店 四個月筆記本銷量。（不用畫圖，只寫數據表）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1" style="margin-top:12px;">📐 繪圖實戰區 — 從數據到圖表</div>
<div style="text-align:center; margin:12px 0; padding:10px; background:#FFFBEB; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:14px; color:var(--blue);">🖊️ 練習一：根據下表繪製簡單棒形圖</strong>
<svg height="320" viewbox="0 0 344 320" width="344" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line stroke="#374151" stroke-width="2" x1="85" x2="85" y1="35" y2="290"></line><line stroke="#374151" stroke-width="2" x1="85" x2="324" y1="290" y2="290"></line><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="290.0" y2="290.0"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="294.0">0</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="258.125" y2="258.125"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="262.125">25</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="226.25" y2="226.25"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="230.25">50</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="194.375" y2="194.375"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="198.375">75</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="162.5" y2="162.5"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="166.5">100</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="130.625" y2="130.625"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="134.625">125</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="98.75" y2="98.75"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="102.75">150</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="66.875" y2="66.875"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="70.875">175</text><line stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-width="0.5" x1="85" x2="324" y1="35.0" y2="35.0"></line><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="39.0">200</text><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="77" y="39">(件)</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90,14,162)" x="14" y="162">銷售量</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="114.875" y="308">一月</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="174.625" y="308">二月</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="234.375" y="308">三月</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="294.125" y="308">四月</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="172" y="25">請根據數據繪製棒形圖</text><rect fill="none" height="255" stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-dasharray="4,3" stroke-width="1" width="40" x="94" y="35"></rect><rect fill="none" height="255" stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-dasharray="4,3" stroke-width="1" width="40" x="152" y="35"></rect><rect fill="none" height="255" stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-dasharray="4,3" stroke-width="1" width="40" x="210" y="35"></rect><rect fill="none" height="255" stroke="#E5E7EB" stroke-dasharray="4,3" stroke-width="1" width="40" x="268" y="35"></rect><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="172" y="322">（請在虛線框內畫出棒形）</text></svg>
<div style="font-size:10px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:4px;">▲ 數據：一月100件、二月120件、三月150件、四月130件。每格代表25件，請在虛線框內畫出棒形。</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center; margin:12px 0; padding:10px; background:#FFFBEB; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:14px; color:var(--blue);">🖊️ 練習二：根據下表繪製複合棒形圖</strong>
